759	 * Words are lower-cased, typographic apostrophes are folded to straight ones,
760	 * and stop words are skipped. Entries are ordered by count (highest first),
761	 * then alphabetically, so the result is deterministic.
762	 *
763	 * @param {string} text
764	 * @param {number} n How many entries to return; a non-negative integer.
765	 * @returns {Array<{word: string, count: number}>}
