790	 *
791	 * The estimate is the word count divided by the reading rate, rounded up, so
792	 * any text with at least one word takes at least a minute and the empty text
793	 * takes none.
794	 *
795	 * @param {string} text
796	 * @param {number} [wpm=200] Reading rate in words per minute; a positive, finite number.
